land pastures? All to uncover the legendary “glow-in-the-dark” ultimate recipe! Oh, and don’t forget to fund his trips—those plane tickets aren’t cheap, you know 😉</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Milk Tea Time&quot; is simulation business game that includes all the elements of production, deployment and construction. You need to make each cup of milk tea. Research new flavors to win customer praise. Build and decorate your milk tea shop by hand. Create your own beautiful milk tea shop!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/819cb6434135f2c53a370481c9ed9e8af3e595f4/header.jpg?t=1772903328", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/a75d2ec72d93b02acb4104eed5c4f1766a694b8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772903328", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/a75d2ec72d93b02acb4104eed5c4f1766a694b8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772903328", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3,20GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimu